==English==
{{root|en|ine-pro|*sed-}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/ˈɹɛzɪdənsi/}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# The condition of being a [[resident]] of a particular place.
# The [[home]] or [[residence]] of a person, especially in the [[colonies]].
# {{lb|en|US|healthcare}} The position or term of a [[medical]] [[resident]].
# The position of a musical artist who commonly performs at a particular [[venue]].
#: {{ux|en|The trance DJ was keen to secure a '''residency''' in Ibiza.}}
# {{lb|en|espionage}} {{synonym of|en|rezidentura}}

